# Internal revision correspondence and working notes. This repository is
# public and serves GitHub Pages, so the emails, progress trackers, debug
# register and session prompts stay on the local machine and are never
# published. Added 2026-08-14.
docs_implementation/documentation-revisions/
docs_methodology/

# Walkthrough recordings and their working notes. About 250 MB of GIFs and
# MP4s that nothing on the site links to, so publishing them would cost every
# visitor nothing and every clone a quarter of a gigabyte. It was untracked and
# unignored, which is the one combination a single `git add -A` turns into a
# public commit. Stage with `git add -u`, and keep this line either way.
# Added 2026-08-17.
docs_implementation/Demo/
